OL,3,GNEWSAHastening mother's death 'utter   
OL,4,Anonsense', jury told                   
OL,6,FThe Browns Brasseries founder has told 
OL,7,Fa jury the allegation that he and his  
OL,8,Fsister administered liquid morphine to 
OL,9,Fhasten his 100-year-old mother's death 
OL,10,Fwas "utter nonsense".                  
OL,12,FOxford restaurateur Jeremy Mogford, 79,
OL,13,Fand Sarah Pickering, 72, are on trial  
OL,14,Ffor the attempted murder of their      
OL,15,Fmother Pamela Mogford in Bledlow Ridge,
OL,16,FBuckinghamshire. Both deny the charge. 
OL,18,FShe died shortly after midnight on 15  
OL,19,FFebruary 2022.                         
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
